Package: alchemeR
Title: Download 'Alchemer' Survey Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Rousell", "Greg", , "grousell@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to access Alchemer data directly into R using 
  the 'Alchemer' API. 'Alchemer' <https://www.alchemer.com/> is an online survey 
  and data collection software platform. See <https://apihelp.alchemer.com/help> 
  for more information about their API. This package is community-maintained and
  is not officially supported by 'Alchemer'.
